      "role": "user",
      "content": "the hotline stuff feels so useless though. like, i'll talk to someone and then i just hang up and i still have no money, no house, and everyone i know is gonna look at me like i'm a complete failure. it's not just stress, it's like... the math just doesn't work anymore. i've looked at every angle and there's just zero. it feels so heavy and i just want the panic to stop. i just want to stop feeling like this.",
